# Components

## Navbar

Fixed: `w-full top-0 z-50 bg-surface shadow-sm`

## Footer

4-column desktop, stacked mobile.

## Cards

- Min `p-6` (24px)
- Medicine cards: `border-l-4 border-tertiary-container`
- Water/hydration: SVG progress ring with `stroke-dasharray` / `stroke-dashoffset`

## Buttons

```html
<!-- Primary -->
<button class="bg-primary text-white min-h-[56px] rounded-xl active:scale-[0.98]">

<!-- Outlined -->
<button class="border-2 border-current bg-transparent active:scale-[0.98]">
```

Min touch target: 44×44px.
